{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/946143-other-realms","id":946143,"title":"Other realms","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-08T07:20:26-07:00","id":946143,"title":"Other realms","content":"Something that's been nagging me since the PDF came out is the mention in the Legacy section that some legacies like Walkers in the Mist have access to otherworldly realms. So this thread is for speculation on these new realms which apparently aren't tied to the Supernal, Shadow, Unserworld or Lower Depths. What do you think the land of mists is like? What other realms are out there? Are there any other legacies devoted to their study?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T08:49:09-07:00","id":946193,"title":"","content":"The realm of Mists is an Emanation Realm. There's a seperate section on them. Aren't there a couple in Imperial Mysteries?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T09:21:48-07:00","id":946212,"title":"","content":"So what's going on there? I was under the impression that Emanations are in one locality, but the Mists seem to extend everywhere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T09:28:32-07:00","id":946218,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/946143-other-realms?p=946212#post946212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what's going on there? I was under the impression that Emanations are in one locality, but the Mists seem to extend everywhere.</div> </div> </div> </div>We don't know anything more than what is in the 2E core, but the Emanations and many similar phenomena (like manifestations of your Path) will be in the Signs of Sorcery book. You can read the summary from the link in the Stickied thread.<br /> <br /> You can also pitch this to Dave as the next thing for his dev blog, I'm sure a lot of people would support you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","name":"Prometheus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5973_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T09:37:20-07:00","id":946229,"title":"","content":"From Page 250:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The mages of the Walkers in Mist Legacy learn to travel this realm, which clings closely to the material plane. Legacy sorcerers<br /> use it to travel and peer into distant times and places... Irises to the Mists manifest in Arcadian Verges and Astral realms representing the unknown and the future. </div> </div> </div>I dunno. It's possible the author just thought it was an interesting idea without fully thinking through how it meshed with the original attainments of the legacy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T06:02:27-07:00","id":952454,"title":"","content":"Something that's been rattling around in my brain is the question of where the fractures in Space that the Reality Stalkers exploits comes from. I mean, there are a lot of possible causes and certainly more than one contributor the most likely being the GM and Mages, but what if there were something else? Especially since Reality Stalkers seem to find these flaws -everywhere- when they look. So the thought I've been thinking is, what if there's a Lower Depth they're knowingly or unknowingly tied to? It lacks Space and when the RS look with their attainments for flaws in Space it reaches through them to create the flaws they're looking for and consume some Space in the process. The more RS use their attainments the more this Lower Depth can devour.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T15:06:21-07:00","id":952766,"title":"","content":"That's an amusing thought and a possibly terryfing plot twist for a RS player.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T19:40:43-07:00","id":952936,"title":"","content":"&quot;Surprise, you're playing 7th Sea!&quot;<br /> <br /> It's a bit bait and switch for my tastes unless they can redeem themselves somehow or it's not &quot;devour&quot; so much as &quot;change.&quot; Would probably fit some chronicles.<br /> <br /> If Emanation Realms exist truthward from the Fallen World, in the direction of the Supernal, it seems to follow that they could be everywhere and nowhere in the same way as the Astral and the Supernal itself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1134-nicias","name":"Nicias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"274"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T21:16:39-07:00","id":952966,"title":"","content":"Maybe they're skirting the Abyss, riding the edge of its intrusions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T22:40:41-07:00","id":952997,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/946143-other-realms?p=952936#post952936\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If Emanation Realms exist truthward from the Fallen World, in the direction of the Supernal, it seems to follow that they could be everywhere and nowhere in the same way as the Astral and the Supernal itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>This was essentially my interpretation: The Mists would connect to any locality where the appropriate Symbols abound. Keeping things consistent with 1e to a point, well, that generally includes life. (I'd prefer a bit stricter than a single potted plant, though, so I'd interpret this as some amount of age and wildness required or literal mists.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T22:40:41-07:00","id":952998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/946143-other-realms?p=952936#post952936\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If Emanation Realms exist truthward from the Fallen World, in the direction of the Supernal, it seems to follow that they could be everywhere and nowhere in the same way as the Astral and the Supernal itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>This was essentially my interpretation: The Mists would connect to any locality where the appropriate Symbols abound. Keeping things consistent with 1e to a point, well, that generally includes life. (I'd prefer a bit stricter than a single potted plant, though, so I'd interpret this as some amount of age and wildness required or literal mists.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T23:40:03-07:00","id":953013,"title":"","content":"I would miss Life component from Mists - they were added to 1E only too make Walkers in the Mists 'real-nature-loving' druids. Mists are also described as part of Mage!Arcadia general outlook, so mixing more Arcana is not needed in my POV.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T01:19:21-07:00","id":953034,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/946143-other-realms?p=952936#post952936\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;Surprise, you're playing 7th Sea!&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> It's a bit bait and switch for my tastes unless they can redeem themselves somehow or it's not &amp;quot;devour&amp;quot; so much as &amp;quot;change.&amp;quot; Would probably fit some chronicles.<br /> <br /> If Emanation Realms exist truthward from the Fallen World, in the direction of the Supernal, it seems to follow that they could be everywhere and nowhere in the same way as the Astral and the Supernal itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't pull that on a player. If they played a RS I'd run the idea past them first. However, as a secret for PCs to discover or Mystery to unravel where none of them are RS I'd consider it fair.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T01:42:42-07:00","id":953045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/946143-other-realms?p=946229#post946229\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From Page 250:<br /> <br /> <br /> I dunno. It's possible the author just thought it was an interesting idea without fully thinking through how it meshed with the original attainments of the legacy.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're overthinking it. While someone could enter the Mists using the standard means for entering an Emanation, a Walker can also harness it according to the rules of their Attainments, as hard-coded by those Attainments. That means you don't need to worry about anything but the Attainment rules -- they don't stack with the considerations for an Emanation because the Attainments override all such considerations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Writer, Game Designer, Pro since 99.<br /> <br /> Thoughts at <a href=\"http://mobunited.com\" target=\"_blank\">mobunited.com</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/164-malcolm","name":"Malcolm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T01:50:14-07:00","id":953046,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/946143-other-realms?p=946212#post946212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what's going on there? I was under the impression that Emanations are in one locality, but the Mists seem to extend everywhere.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Emanations are not anywhere; there's no spatial relationship between them and the material plane except through Irises and Verges. You can talk about a connection to a particular Iris or Verge, but not that an Emanation is in a particular &quot;place&quot; related to the material realm once you pass fully into it. Some are exceptions and reflect the material realm in specific ways, but these are specific to the Emanation, not a universal rule. The Place Between does have this characteristic, but there might be an Emanation called Corbenic that is just one specific place (the Grail Castle) that does not reflect the material at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Writer, Game Designer, Pro since 99.<br /> <br /> Thoughts at <a href=\"http://mobunited.com\" target=\"_blank\">mobunited.com</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/164-malcolm","name":"Malcolm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T02:26:20-07:00","id":953060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malcolm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/946143-other-realms?p=953045#post953045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're overthinking it. While someone could enter the Mists using the standard means for entering an Emanation, a Walker can also harness it according to the rules of their Attainments, as hard-coded by those Attainments. That means you don't need to worry about anything but the Attainment rules -- they don't stack with the considerations for an Emanation because the Attainments override all such considerations.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was meaning from a setting rather than a mechanical point of view. The Walkers have this initmate connection to the Mists, but they use it for something that seems kinda unrelated to the theme of the realm. It says it lies close to the material realm but I don't really know what it means by that. I kinda assumed when first reading it that that the realm would have, I dunno, moving Irises or something; so a Walker entering it from anywhere would make sense, but that's not the case.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T11:13:49-07:00","id":953302,"title":"","content":"Another idea that's I've been pondering. The Speed Force from the Flash. I could see a legacy based on it in much the same way Walkers in the Mist function, but it would be Time primary and Forces Secondary and Mages in the legacy derive the power for their attainments from it.<br /> <br /> Skipping back a second, if the RS were connected to a Space devouring Lower Depth, would it have denizens? What would they be like? Do you think there might be entities dwelling in the Mists that Walkers tread?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T23:21:14-07:00","id":953690,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/946143-other-realms?p=953060#post953060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I was meaning from a setting rather than a mechanical point of view. The Walkers have this initmate connection to the Mists, but they use it for something that seems kinda unrelated to the theme of the realm. It says it lies close to the material realm but I don't really know what it means by that. I kinda assumed when first reading it that that the realm would have, I dunno, moving Irises or something; so a Walker entering it from anywhere would make sense, but that's not the case.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> When a Walker peers into/travels through the Mists they don't need an Iris -- or rather, they generate one restricted to the functions of the Attainment that can't be used to draw other people through or anything. Ordinary people have to seek out Irises the usual way. In the Legacy's case it serves as flavour and a rationale for their Attainments. Remember that even though we create Legacies using mechanistic game rules, in the world mages have to actually interact with Mysteries and link some external truth to their inner being, so even as &quot;flavour,&quot; it's necessary.<br /> <br /> If the Walkers ever get revised we can of course use the Emanation a bit more deeply.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Writer, Game Designer, Pro since 99.<br /> <br /> Thoughts at <a href=\"http://mobunited.com\" target=\"_blank\">mobunited.com</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/164-malcolm","name":"Malcolm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-19T12:29:25-07:00","id":953955,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/946143-other-realms?p=953302#post953302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Skipping back a second, if the RS were connected to a Space devouring Lower Depth, would it have denizens? What would they be like?</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yog-Sothoth\" target=\"_blank\">Yog-Sothoth</a>? A place lacking space would mean there is no distinction between &quot;here&quot; and &quot;there&quot;. If it is, it is &quot;everywhere&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}